      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Auto convert needs to be per avatar or per user's own settings that everyone else sees whether you have it set on or not.  If i turn off dynamicbone replacement to fix my bone issues, others have it on and see bad bone movement.  It should also be off by default, and grab should be off by default.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
