  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-21T19:46:41.704Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Phys bone and dynamic bone is basically different component. Modern dynamic bone based avatars are very complex and exquisitely set with complex mechanisms. \n\nSo they are very hard to convert phys bone, and they must be a problem for a very long time. Especially for high quality public avatars and 50$+ booth paid avatars usually are these types.(It means it can cause many users to get out from VRChat)\nI think this problem is similar with SDK2 avatars are not converted to SDK3 avatars.\n\nMy suggestions\n\n1. Dynamic bone based avatars are 'not automatically converted as phys bone components' in game and remain as dynamic bone based. but they cannot get new interact functions with phys bone update. \n\n2. Auto convert function must in SDK, but not in game functions or options. Just show 'would be deprecated someday' to dynamic bone based components.\n\n3. Give special tag for Phys bone based avatars(with no dy bone), and allow uses to see other guys phys bone components to interact.\n\n4. Give Better performance tag for phys bone based avatars.\n\n5. Categorize Public avatar worlds with phys bone public avatars.",
